ng and conscientiousness. So we might shift recommendation to B or keep A but note concerns.\n\nGiven the process, we should make a contribution that builds on prior discussion. We could say: \"I see the strengths of A, but I'm concerned about unorganized behavior and resistance to criticism, which could impact reliability and adaptability. Candidate B shows strong stress handling and conscientiousness, and while he has interpersonal issues, they may be manageable.\" Then we could adjust vote to B.\n\nWe need to reference explicit facts: A can be unorganized, not good at taking criticism. B is very conscientious, handles stress well. Provide implication: B may be more reliable and stress resilient.\n\nThus we can change vote to Candidate B.\n\nWe must include metadata JSON with vote.\n\nProceed."}
